{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"AKLT模型"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“AKLT 模型”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#数学物理</p>\n<p>AKLT 模型是一维"},{"Local":{"url":"量子Heisenberg模型","text":"量子 Heisenberg 模型"}},{"Plain":"的推广.</p>\n<p>Hamilton 量\n$$\r\nH_{\\text{AKLT}} = \\sum \\frac{1}{2} S_i \\cdot S_j + \\frac{1}{6} (S_i \\cdot S_j)^2,\r\n$$\n其中 $S_i$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"自旋","text":"自旋"}},{"Plain":" $1$ 的算子.</p>\n"}]}}